  "description": "Process a holds an optimistic (dbOptimistic) dynaset on row 1 with Edit pending after assigning N. On the Jet 4 MDB fixture, process b changes N of the same row (a different value) by a statement while the Edit is pending (errors recorded). Process a then calls Update, reads the row and EditMode, calls Update a second time, Move 0, then CancelUpdate, reading the row, EditMode and DBEngine.Errors after each. Process b finally reads rows 1, 2 and 64. Asks whether the first Update is refused, the second succeeds and what the row holds.",
